## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` to ensure no Typescript compilation errors were introduced by the prop extraction.
- The `npm run dev` Vite server will compile the app and we will verify there are zero build-time warnings regarding missing imports.

### Manual Verification
1. I will ask you to open the application in the browser.
2. Navigate to the **"Nova entrada"** tab in each module (Recibos, DS, Penhoras).
3. Ensure the forms render correctly and the sidebar with recent records works.
4. Verify that changing inputs (like Gestor or Processo) works without crashing.
